{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790980000, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Debugging a tool through the same MCP server (narration-paced)"}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;36m== Debugging a tool through the same MCP server ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.3, "o", "test_connection says \"SSH failed\"; list_devices reaches the same nodes. Why?\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "Real calls and real results, via the scale-guinstall MCP server.\r\n"]
[21.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 1. The symptom ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.9, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"yes fix the test_connection\"\r\n"]
[21.95, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=\"scale-server1\")   test_connection(node=\"scale-client1\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.0, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.05, "o", "  $ sudo ssh -p 22 root@scale-server1 /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a\r\n"]
[22.08, "o", "  \u001b[31m[ERROR] SSH connection to scale-server1 failed (exit 255).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.11, "o", "  (client1: the same.)  No output at all, and GPFS is active on every node by now.\r\n"]
[45.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 2. Comparing the two tools ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[45.9, "o", "\u001b[2;37m(no tool call: the agent reads scale-server.py)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[45.95, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[46.0, "o", "  list_devices:    sudo ssh <node> lsblk ...            no -p, no user: ssh config decides\r\n"]
[46.03, "o", "  test_connection: sudo ssh -p 22 root@<node> mmgetstate -a   forced port and user\r\n"]
[46.06, "o", "                   any non-zero exit of the remote command -> \"SSH connection failed\"\r\n"]
[46.09, "o", "  Two suspects: the forced -p 22 / root@, and conflating a remote failure with an SSH one.\r\n"]
[67.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 3. Ground truth from the operator ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[67.5, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"correction on the command\"  [pastes the output of:]\r\n"]
[67.55, "o", "\u001b[2;37m      $ ssh scale-server1 sudo /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a; echo \"exit=$?\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[67.6, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[67.65, "o", "  Warning: Permanently added '[scale-server1]:2223' (ED25519) to the list of known hosts.\r\n"]
[67.68, "o", "  Node number  Node name               GPFS state\r\n"]
[67.71, "o", "             1  scale-gui1-qvtqsu3k     active\r\n"]
[67.74, "o", "             2  scale-server1-qvtqsu3k  active\r\n"]
[67.77, "o", "             3  scale-server2-qvtqsu3k  active\r\n"]
[67.8, "o", "             ...  (client1, client2, proto1, proto2: active)\r\n"]
[67.83, "o", "  exit=0\r\n"]
[67.86, "o", "\u001b[2;37m(all seven nodes active, and the nodes are being reached on port 2223, not 22)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 4. Two experiments ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.5, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=\"scale-server1\", port=\"2223\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.55, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.6, "o", "  $ sudo ssh -p 2223 root@scale-server1 /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a\r\n"]
[87.63, "o", "  (full node table: all active)\r\n"]
[87.66, "o", "  [OK] SSH connection to scale-server1 successful.   [OK] GPFS is running on target node.\r\n"]
[87.69, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=\"scale-server1\", port=\"2223\", user=\"itzuser\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.74, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.79, "o", "  \u001b[31mbash: line 1: /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate: Permission denied\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.82, "o", "  \u001b[31m[ERROR] SSH connection to scale-server1 failed (exit 126).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.85, "o", "\u001b[2;37m(a remote mmgetstate failure, reported as an SSH failure: the second bug)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[113.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 5. The fix ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[113.5, "o", "\u001b[2;37m(code change, no tool call; commit b81f1aa)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[113.55, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[113.6, "o", "  user and port: optional, passed to ssh only when supplied (backend, MCP tool, GUI)\r\n"]
[113.63, "o", "  reachability first: ssh <node> true;  then mmgetstate -a as its own step\r\n"]
[113.66, "o", "  mmgetstate non-zero -> \"SSH works, but mmgetstate -a exited N\" + its output\r\n"]
[113.69, "o", "  tests: backend 200 passed, MCP 55 passed\r\n"]
[141.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 6. After the redeploy ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[141.9, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"redeployed the backend, run test_connection again\"\r\n"]
[141.95, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=...)   for scale-server1, scale-proto1, scale-client2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.0, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.05, "o", "  $ sudo ssh -p 22 root@scale-server1 true\r\n"]
[142.08, "o", "  \u001b[31m[ERROR] SSH connection to scale-server1 failed (exit 255).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.11, "o", "  new backend is live (the reachability step appears), but the agent's MCP client\r\n"]
[142.14, "o", "  still sends the old root / 22 defaults\r\n"]
[142.17, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=..., user=\"\", port=\"\")   for the same three nodes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.22, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.27, "o", "  $ sudo ssh scale-server1 true\r\n"]
[142.3, "o", "  [OK] SSH connection to scale-server1 successful.\r\n"]
[142.33, "o", "  $ sudo ssh scale-server1 /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a\r\n"]
[142.36, "o", "  (full node table: all active)   [OK] GPFS is running on target node.\r\n"]
[167.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 7. After the restart ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[167.9, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"restarted\"\r\n"]
[167.95, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mtest_connection(node=\"scale-server1\")      # no user, no port\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[168.0, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[168.05, "o", "  $ sudo ssh scale-server1 true\r\n"]
[168.08, "o", "  [OK] SSH connection to scale-server1 successful.\r\n"]
[168.11, "o", "  $ sudo ssh scale-server1 /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a\r\n"]
[168.14, "o", "  (full node table: all seven active)   [OK] GPFS is running on target node.\r\n"]
[181.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== Closing ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[181.9, "o", "One sentence from the operator, a few read-only experiments, one confirmation.\r\n"]
[182.2, "o", "A confusing exit 255 became two real bugs and a verified fix.\r\n"]
[195.6, "o", ""]
